<title>USA: Texas/w Okla feedlot cattle quiet, no sales- USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas/w Okla feedlot cattle quiet, no sales- USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was at a standstill in the Panhandle area Thursday, USDA said. Slaughter steers and heifers not tested. Feedlots reporting light inquiry from buyers. 91,400 head confirmed for the week to date which includes 17,200 formulated cattle and 2,800 contracts to be shipped this week.</p>
<p>Confirmed -    None   Week Ago - 19,900   Year Ago -    400</p>
<p>Wk to Date - 91,400   Week Ago - 75,600   Year Ago - 77,100</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720--</p>
